<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Africa &amp; Overseas half yr share dips.</title>
<headline>Africa &amp; Overseas half yr share dips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     24.3	  vs    29.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    2.59	 vs     2.99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    5.85	 vs     7.85</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.44	 vs     2.83</p>
<p>    Interest received	1.68	 vs     1.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		 107.24	 vs   110.19</p>
<p>Full name: Africa &amp; Overseas Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that while operating profits for the current year were unlikely to exceed those of 1996, operational and financial were sound such that the company was well positioned to benefit from growth in its Queenspark division and exports, as well as any improvement in the general trading environment.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
